WEBVTT

00:12:29.567 --> 00:12:30.954
to a vocation,

00:12:30.978 --> 00:12:32.133
to a philosophy or faith

00:12:32.157 --> 00:12:33.545
and to a community.

00:12:33.569 --> 00:12:36.873
And the fulfillment in their lives
will depend on how well they choose

00:12:36.897 --> 00:12:38.489
and execute on those commitments.

00:12:38.513 --> 00:12:39.825
Social freedom sucks.

00:12:39.849 --> 00:12:42.738
Political freedom is great,
and economic freedom is great,

00:12:42.762 --> 00:12:47.039
but social freedom, not being committed
to other people, is just useless.

00:12:47.063 --> 00:12:51.813
The free man is the unremembered man,
because he's not committed to anything.

00:12:51.837 --> 00:12:54.844
So you want to be able to plant yourself
down on the other side.

00:12:54.868 --> 00:12:58.340
CA: So, help me understand that better,
because I think at first pass,

00:12:58.364 --> 00:13:02.826
someone listening to that might say,
"That's a little bit terrifying.